/**********

PL/pgSQL function get_lab_order_count_rpp(date, date, integer)

Created: 05/2014
Version: 1.0
Author: Phil Belyaev

Given input parameters for a reporting period start and end dates, and provider ID, 
calculate and return the count of active lab orders for patients assigned to the provider.

*********/

BEGIN
	
	RETURN COUNT(DISTINCT lo_id) FROM v_patient_lab_orders 
	WHERE provider_id = provider AND 
	date_trunc('day', order_date) BETWEEN period_start AND period_end AND 
	lo_active
END
