    AS $$

/**********

PL/pgSQL function get_measure_denominator_patients_education_provider_2014(integer, date, date, integer, NVARCHAR(MAX)) 

Created: 10/2014
Version: 1.2

Given input parameters for a measure ID, reporting period start and end dates, and provider ID, 
calculate and return the patient identifiers in the denominator for the Meaningful Use Report, in accordance with the 
2014 Test Procedure for Â§170.314(g)(1) Automated numerator recording & 
Â§170.314(g)(2) Automated measure calculation.

Call subordinate functions for individual measure denominator calculations.

CHANGE LOG
1.3     Added M2018_ACI_CCTPE_2 and tin parameter for MeaningfulUseID.ACI_2018_CC_SECURE_MSG. (tcp 2/16/2018)
1.2     Added M2016_9_ID for MeaningfulUseID.MOD_STAGE_2_2016_OBJECTIVE_9_SECURE_MSG. (tcp 3/10/2016)
