PL/pgSQL function get_patient_recall_list_565_rpp(date, date, integer)

Created: 11/2014
Version: 1.0
Author: Phil Belyaev

Given input parameters for a reporting period start and end dates, and provider ID, 
calculate and return the list of patients 
who have had an exam with the provider, excluding those currently greater 
than 5 years of age and less than 65 years of age, 
who were sent a recall (reminder) during the reporting period. 

*********/

BEGIN
	
	RETURN QUERY SELECT DISTINCT patient_id FROM v_patient_recalls_565 
