PL/pgSQL function get_soc_reconciled_list_rppt(date, date, integer, NVARCHAR(MAX))

Created: 11/2014
Version: 1.0
Author: Phil Belyaev

Given input parameters for a reporting period start and end dates, provider ID,
calculate and return the lists of
incoming summary of care referral documents and
patients transitioned into care under the provider during the reporting period.

*********/

DECLARE
	SUMMARY_OF_CARE_INCOMING integer := 3
BEGIN

	RETURN QUERY SELECT DISTINCT vrdr.received_id= provider AND (tin is null OR length(tin) = 0 OR received_office_tin = tin)
